        "description": "<p>\n\tThe New York May 29 world premiere event for <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lI7tMxzSJ7w\"><em>C++: The Documentary</em></a> was followed by a live panel discussion with Matt Godbolt (moderator), Bjarne Stroustrup, Gabriel Dos Reis, Nina Ranns, Eric Lubin, and Herb Sutter. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zMYZ5MFQAho\"><strong>The video recording of that panel</strong></a> is being released worldwide on YouTube tomorrow (Saturday) at 19:00 UTC. Click <strong data-end=\"323\" data-start=\"310\">Notify me</strong> on the YouTube Premiere page to get a reminder when it goes live.</p>\n<p>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zMYZ5MFQAho\"><img alt=\"Panel.png\" src=\"https://isocpp.org/files/img/Panel.png\" style=\"width: 878px; margin: 10px; height: 495px;\" /></a></p>",
